H5806G.def:
A woman living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Rois 22:42; 
daughter of: Shilhi (H7977); married to Asa (H0609); 
mother of: Jehoshaphat (H3092I)
§ Azubah = "forsaken"
1) wife of Caleb, the son of Hezron
2) daughter of Shilhi, wife of king Asa, and mother of king Jehoshaphat of Judah

H5811.def:
A man of the tribe of Reuben living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 5:8; 
son of: Shema (H8087H); 
father of: Bela (H1106H) 
§ Azaz = "strong"
a Reubenite, father of Bela

H5817.def:
Someone descended from Uzziel who was a man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exode 6:18; 
son of: Kohath (H6955); 
brother of: Amram (H6019), Izhar (H3324) and Hebron (H2275B); 
father of: Mishael (H4332), Elizaphan (H0469), Sithri (H5644), Micah (H4318J) and Isshiah (H3449I)
Group of uz.zi.el (עֻזִּיאֵל "Uzziel" H5816) 
§ Uzzielites, of Uzziel "my strength is God"
descendants of Uzziel

H5818G.def:
A king of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Rois 14:21; 
son of: Amaziah (H0558) and Jecoliah (H3203); married to Jerusha (H3388); 
father of: Jotham (H3147H); also called Azariah at 2 Rois 14:21; 15.1,6,7,8,17,23,27; 1xKJV: Ozias at Matthieu 1:8,9; 
§ Uzziah = "my strength is Jehovah"
1) son of king Amaziah of Judah and king of Judah himself for 52 years; also 'Azariah'
2) a Kohathite Levite and ancestor of Samuel
3) a priest of the sons of Harim who took a foreign wife in the time of Ezra
4) a Judaite, father of Athaiah or Uthai
5) father of Jehonathan, one of David's overseers

H5818H.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:24; 
son of: Uriel (H0222); 
father of: Shaul (H7586J); also called Azariah at 1 Chroniques 6:36; 
Also named: a.zar.yah (עֲזַרְיָ֫הוּ "Azariah" H5838w)
§ Uzziah = "my strength is Jehovah"
1) son of king Amaziah of Judah and king of Judah himself for 52 years; also 'Azariah'
2) a Kohathite Levite and ancestor of Samuel
3) a priest of the sons of Harim who took a foreign wife in the time of Ezra
4) a Judaite, father of Athaiah or Uthai
5) father of Jehonathan, one of David's overseers

H5820K.def:
Azmaveth = "strong unto death"
a place in Benjamin; 
Another name of bet az.ma.vet (בֵּית־עַזְמָ֫וֶת "Beth-azmaveth" H1041)

H5829G.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:4; 
son of: Hur (H2354); 
brother of: Uri (H0221), Shobal (H7732H), Salma (H8007H), Hareph (H2780), Jezreel (H3157J), Ishma (H3457), Idbash (H3031), Hazzelelponi (H6753) and Penuel (H6439H); 
father of: Hushah (H2364)
§ Ezer = "treasure"
1) father of Hushah of the sons of Hur
2) a Gadite chief who fought with David
3) a Levite who aided in repairing the wall of Jerusalem in the time of Nehemiah

H5831.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at Esdras 7:1; 
son of: Seraiah (H8304H); 
brother of: Jehozadak (H3087)
Aramaic of ez.ra (עֶזְרָא "Ezra" H5830) 
§ Ezra = "help"
the priest and scribe who led the reforms of the returned exiles in Jerusalem; co-worker with Nehemiah

H5858A.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 10:28; 
son of: Joktan (H3355); 
brother of: Almodad (H0486), Sheleph (H8026), Hazarmaveth (H2700), Jerah (H3392), Hadoram (H1913A), Uzal (H0187), Diklah (H1853), Abimael (H0039), Sheba (H7614H), Ophir (H0211), Havilah (H2341I) and Jobab (H3103)
Another spelling of o.val (עוֹבָל "Obal" H5745)
§ Ebal = "stone" or "bare mountain"
Arabian people, descended from Joktan

H5858B.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:23; 
son of: Shobal (H7732); 
brother of: Alvan (H5935), Manahath (H4506B), Shepho (H8195) and Onam (H0208)
§ Ebal = "stone" or "bare mountain"
a son of Shobal

H5867C.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 10:22; 
son of: Shem (H8035); 
brother of: Asshur (H0804H), Arpachshad (H0775), Lud (H3865) and Aram (H0758)
§ Elam = "eternity"
Male living at the time of the first Patriarchs (Genèse 10:22; 1 Chroniques 1:17)

H5867G.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:24; 
son of: Shashak (H8349); 
brother of: Ishpan (H3473), Eber (H5677J), Eliel (H0447I), Abdon (H5658I), Zichri (H2147I), Hanan (H2605), Hananiah (H2608O), Anthothijah (H6070), Iphdeiah (H3301) and Penuel (H6439I)
§ Elam = "eternity"
Male living at the time of the first Patriarchs (Genèse 10:22; 1 Chroniques 1:17)

H5867H.def:
A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 26:3; 
son of: Meshelemiah (H4920); 
brother of: Zechariah (H2148A), Jediael (H3043J), Zebadiah (H2069J), Jathniel (H3496), Jehohanan (H3076I) and Eliehoenai (H0454A)
§ Elam = "eternity"
Male living at the time of the first Patriarchs (Genèse 10:22; 1 Chroniques 1:17)

H5897.def:
A man living at the time before the Flood, first mentioned at Genèse 4:18; 
son of: Enoch (H2585); 
father of: Mehujael (H4232) 
§ Irad = "fleet"
son of Enoch, grandson of Cain, and father of Mehujael
